cabo-rendering-system provides CMake targets:

    find_package(CaboRenderingSystem CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE CRS::CaboRenderingSystem)

Copy ${CaboRenderingSystem_SHADER_DIR} next to your executable as Shaders/,
or pass it to ForwardRenderingSettings::shader_directory.
dxil.dll (from directx-dxc) must also be placed next to your executable.
